    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255550/extras/6294793fa19cbbdd9dfb4b4ff3b40138.poster.avif?t=1727687522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255550/extras/6294793fa19cbbdd9dfb4b4ff3b40138.webm?t=1727687522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Taxi Copter is a precise platform game that will test your dexterity in a pixel art style.<br>Relax with retro beat music in a modern form, prepared especially for you.<br><br>Avoid the pigeons. Remember that every collision, hard landing or passenger push results in the loss of points and irreparable damage to the helicopter!<br><br>Let's go, a big city full of passengers awaits!<br>Transport everyone!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255550/extras/6294793fa19cbbdd9dfb4b4ff3b40138.poster.avif?t=1727687522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255550/extras/6294793fa19cbbdd9dfb4b4ff3b40138.webm?t=1727687522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Taxi Copter is a precise platform game that will test your dexterity in a pixel art style.<br>Relax with retro beat music in a modern form, prepared especially for you.<br><br>Avoid the pigeons. Remember that every collision, hard landing or passenger push results in the loss of points and irreparable damage to the helicopter!<br><br>Let's go, a big city full of passengers awaits!<br>Transport everyone!",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of a Taxi Copter driver. Pick up passengers and drive them to their destination, avoid pigeons, earn money, get stars and unlock more levels. Fight against the gravity, be gentle, it's a helicopter, not a tank! A city full of passengers (and pigeons!) is waiting for you!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hungarian, Hindi",
